  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  BinomCDFc
  @  Upper tail at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "BinomCDFc: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → ntv pv Xv « ntv 0 + pv 0 + Xv 0 + → nt p X « '1-(IFTE(X<0;0;IFTE(X≥nt;1;Σ(Jx;0;IP(X);COMB(nt;Jx)*(p^Jx)*((1-p)^(nt-Jx))))))' →Num ntv pv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
